{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927630/extras/208d28e94e7aa9209d73a244c7b9c73a.avif?t=1754635846\" width=1600 height=210 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Ruiya Continent has been invaded by hordes of succubus! Otherworldly heroes are summoned to confront this threat. Light on narrative, your mission is clear</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927630/extras/086c8c9dc23385932e7e3714b514dcf1.avif?t=1754635846\" width=1600 height=214 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udde1\ufe0f Conquer Succubus Boss</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat witch bosses in each stage to subdue and recruit them! Recruited succubus:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight alongside you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock exclusive galleries!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1 Unrestricted Skill System</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match countless skills freely with no limitations. Forge your ultimate squad through limitless customization!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 Gear Enhancement</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Empower equipment with game-changing special effects through upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc41\ufe0f Visible Encounters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No annoying random battles! Spot enemies on the field and engage strategically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd04 Stress-Free Progression</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto-replenish HP/MP before every battle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zero penalties upon defeat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto-battle mode</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3927630?t=1754635846","backgrou